Z||000001||chester||09-17-2001||11:16 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B>I need to find some Polished stainless or an acrylic mirrored panel that is at least 24"by24". I've looked everywhere. I need help. Please someone know something. Thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Josh,<BR>If this is for the rear decklid mirrors Chris Berry sells the stainless steel panels for $75.00 already precut. You can get them for GT or Coupe. Chris recommends silconing the panels along with 3m double sided tape. His email is CBTAZ1@AOL.com . Tell him I sent ya.<P>Rob D.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigline.jpg">   <BR>Modified 2.8<BR>2.5" Drop<BR>11" Brakes<BR>17" Revolutions<BR>RCC Coilover Suspension||||reg||1
Z||000002||88CoupeV6||09-17-2001||11:22 AM||||Thanks, Rob. I will do that. I also needed some for something else. That is what I needed the big sheets for. I may ask him if he has any uncut.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Anyone else know of anything uncut?<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">   <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B> :D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
Z||000003||Joe Torma||09-17-2001||11:51 AM||||I can get mirrored polystyrene 4x8 sheet.  I have a few things I would do with it.  It is like 1/16 thin, very lightwieght, self adhesive, and very flexable(lots of possibilities).<P>If you(and maybe others) want to split the cost with me, I'd order it.  It is fairly expensive...not as much as other things like mirrored lexan.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig1.gif">  <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A>||||reg||1
